<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Desc started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Desc started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Securities Corp analyst Frederick Searby started coverage of Mexican conglomerate Desc Sociedad de Fomento Industrial SA de CV Wednesday with a rating of neutral.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Searby said he no longer viewed Desc's valuation as attractive.</p>
<p>-- &quot;With 100 percent of the chemical group's sales and 80 percent of the auto parts group sales being dollar denominated, Desc would certainly be one of our preferred sales in the event of a significant weakening in the peso,&quot; he wrote.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipt was up 11/16 to 32-7/8, above a 12-month closing high.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
